{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, בְּרַם","hw":"בְּרַם","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַם</span></big></big>  <strong>adv.</strong> with advers. force, <strong>only, nevertheless (</strong>der. uncertain: Nö <sup>M 202</sup> = <span dir=\"rtl\">מָא</span> + <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּר</span>, lit. <em>except what:</em> 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַם</span> often for <span dir=\"rtl\">אַךְ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אוּלָם</span>; Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܪܰܡ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:16\" href=\"/Exodus.9.16\">Ex 9:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 21:21\" href=\"/Exodus.21.21\">21:21</a>, and in NT for πλήν; Chr-Pal. <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܪܢ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܒܪܝܢ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:28\" href=\"/Daniel.2.28\">Dn 2:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:12\" href=\"/Daniel.4.12\">4:12</a> hew down the tree, etc., <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּרַם</span> … <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁבֻקוּ</span> <em>only</em> leave the stump, etc., v <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:20\" href=\"/Daniel.4.20\">20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:17\" href=\"/Daniel.5.17\">5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 5:13\" href=\"/Ezra.5.13\">Ezr 5:13</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, ברר","prev":"BDB Aramaic, אַרְכֻבָּה"}